OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FA man is set to go on trial for the
OL,8,Fkilling of rap icon Tupac Shakur after
OL,9,Fhe was shot dead in Las Vegas nearly
OL,10,F30 years ago.
OL,12,FDuane "Keffe D" Davis, 63, faces one
OL,13,Fcharge of murder with a deadly weapon,
OL,14,Fwith the intent to promote, further or
OL,15,Fassist a criminal gang for Shakur's
OL,16,Fdeath.
OL,18,FThe trial begins on Monday.
OL,26,@tD@GOUtD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
