OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FShakur was in Las Vegas on September
OL,8,F7, 1996, to watch a Mike Tyson boxing
OL,9,Fmatch before travelling in a black BMW
OL,10,Fwith music mogul Marion "Suge" Knight
OL,11,Fto Club 662, where the rapper was due
OL,12,Fto perform.
OL,14,FA white Cadillac pulled up beside
OL,15,Fthem, and gunfire erupted, with
OL,16,FShakur, who was sitting in the
OL,17,Fpassenger seat, shot multiple times.
OL,19,FHe died six days later, while Knight
OL,20,Fsurvived the attack.
OL,26,@rD@YOUrD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
