CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FThe case remained unsolved for years
OL,8,Fbefore public statements and a tell-
OL,9,Fall memoir by Davis helped revive the
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,FDavis, who was a leader of the South
OL,13,FSide Compton Crips at the time of
OL,14,FShakur's death, was arrested in 2023
OL,15,Fand has pleaded not guilty.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FProsecutors are not alleging that
OL,8,FDavis was the person who pulled the
OL,9,Ftrigger. Instead, they plan to argue
OL,10,Fthat he helped orchestrate the killing
OL,11,Fand provided the gun used in the
OL,12,Fshooting.
OL,14,FThe trial is unlikely to find out who
OL,15,Ffired the fatal shots.
OL,17,FDavis co-authored the memoir Compton
OL,18,FStreet Legends, which describes his
OL,19,Faccount of the shooting.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
