PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FThe book says he obtained a handgun
OL,8,Ffrom an associate and threw it into
OL,9,Fthe back seat of the Cadillac, but
OL,10,Fdoes not identify who fired the shots.
OL,12,FOrlando "Baby Lane" Anderson, Davis'
OL,13,Fnephew, has long been considered a
OL,14,Fsuspect in the killing. However, he
OL,15,Fwas never charged and died two years
OL,16,Fafter Shakur died in an unrelated gang
OL,17,Fshooting in Compton, California.
OL,26,@tD@IOUtD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
