CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FTwo other men who were in the
OL,8,FCadillac, Deandrae "Freaky" Smith and
OL,9,FTerry "Bubble Up" Brown, have also
OL,10,Fsince died.
OL,12,FProsecutors are expected to call
OL,13,Fbetween 35 and 45 witnesses during the
OL,14,Ftrial, including people who saw Shakur
OL,15,Fshortly before he was shot and others
OL,16,Fwho were part of Shakur's or Davis'
OL,17,Fcircles at the time.
OL,26,@pD@TOUpD@[O]qD@GOUqD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
