PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FThe witness list includes former Las
OL,8,FVegas mayor Oscar Goodman and members
OL,9,Fof Shakur's family, although not
OL,10,Feveryone named is expected to testify.
OL,12,FLawyers may also ask potential jurors
OL,13,Fwhether they are familiar with certain
OL,14,Fwitnesses.
OL,16,FLeonard Jefferson, a California
OL,17,Fresident who pulled up alongside the
OL,18,FBMW and took what became the last
OL,19,Fknown photograph of Shakur alive, is
OL,20,Fexpected to give evidence.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
