PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FThe state is also expected to call
OL,8,FDenvonta Lee, who was affiliated with
OL,9,Fthe South Side Crips.
OL,11,FIn grand jury testimony, Lee said the
OL,12,Frival Crips and Mob Piru gangs were
OL,13,Flinked to the rival Death Row Records
OL,14,Fand Bad Boy Records labels.
OL,16,FAlthough Lee was not present on the
OL,17,Fnight of the shooting, he testified
OL,18,Fthat Anderson did not have a clear
OL,19,Fshot, so Smith took the gun and fired.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
