PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FHe also said Davis was in charge, gave
OL,8,Fthe gun to Anderson, and that Anderson
OL,9,Fpassed it to Smith.
