OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FOther witnesses who previously gave
OL,8,Fevidence to the grand jury include
OL,9,FMalcolm Greenidge, a friend of
OL,10,FShakur's who was travelling with his
OL,11,Fentourage that night, and Reggie
OL,12,FWright, who grew up in Compton and
OL,13,Fworked in security for Death Row
OL,14,FRecords.
OL,16,FThere has also been speculation over
OL,17,Fwhether Sean "Diddy" Combs could
OL,18,Ftestify.
OL,26,@yD@NOUyD@TO]
