OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FCombs is currently serving a four-year
OL,8,Fprison sentence in New Jersey after
OL,9,Fbeing convicted on prostitution-
OL,10,Frelated charges.
OL,12,FDavis alleged in his book that Combs
OL,13,Fwanted Knight and Shakur dead and
OL,14,Foffered him money to kill them. Combs
OL,15,Fhas long denied any involvement in
OL,16,FShakur's killing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
