PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786403882
OL,3,CMan set to stand trial for Tupac
OL,4,CShakur's murder nearly 30 years after
OL,5,Chis death
OL,7,FHis name does not appear on the
OL,8,Fprosecution's witness list, and a
OL,9,Fspokesperson for Combs did not respond
OL,10,Fto requests for comment on whether he
OL,11,Fwould testify.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
